WEBVTT

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.150
Am I going to die?

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:21.610
Ryuji...

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:48.460
"Summer School"

00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:58.120
It's a dragon.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.120
Get it, get it!

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:00.970
Kill it!

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:02.900
Wow!

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:04.280
It's strong.

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:47.970
"The Kidnapped Girl"

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:46.060
Good morning.

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:50.130
Good... good...

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:53.740
Good...

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:54.510
Good morning!

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:55.690
Good morning.

00:02:56.770 --> 00:02:57.530
Morning.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:58.930
Misaki?

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:04.450
Maho-chan?

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.300
Good morning, Ryuji-kun.

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:09.290
Good morning.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:13.040
Ryuji-kun!

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:15.790
Good...

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:17.560
"Good..."

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:21.010
Myorning...

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:22.570
"Good Myorning"

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:25.910
Good morning.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.590
Listen to this, Ryuji.

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:31.890
I saw a really cute girl yesterday out on the town...

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:34.010
but when I followed her, she ran away.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:36.620
You shouldn't follow girls, Masato.

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:38.150
What? Why not?

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.710
Eriko-san?

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:25.960
Ryuji-kun.

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:29.190
Let's go.

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:30.200
"Notice of early departure"

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:34.020
Where are we going?

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:35.900
Get in.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:39.480
You can't just barge in and expect me to...

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:43.480
Ryuji! Who's the hot chick?

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.850
You're skipping class to go on a drive with a hottie?

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:47.530
What a Cinderella boy!

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:48.450
Good luck!

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:49.980
Do you know her?

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:55.780
Nanao Eriko-san. She lived nearby until three years ago.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:57.780
She's Ryuji-kun's second cousin.

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:00.310
She was studying abroad in the United States...

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.940
When did you come back?

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:07.370
Today, of course.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:08.240
Today?

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:12.500
I wanted to see your face as soon as possible!

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.860
What do you want with me?

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:18.400
We're going to get something.

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:20.230
I wanted a man's help.

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:22.930
What kind of thing?

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:24.830
Oh, before that...

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:26.890
Could you open this?

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:33.650
"'Seven Tails' is an organization that recovers Lost Preciouses, the treasures of the world."

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:33.650
"Seven Tails?"

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:36.780
Yeah, it's an organization I created.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.920
Enter your name there.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:47.140
"Kisaragi Ryuji"

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:49.480
Congratulations!

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:53.540
Nanao Eriko

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:53.540
You have been registered as the
 first assistant of "Seven Tails!"

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:57.600
You'll work like a horse for Captain Eriko!

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:04.300
You have reached your destination.

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:08.030
I'm surprised the Society approved.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:09.900
Take a closer look.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.930
"Currently awaiting for approval from the Society of International Treasure Recovery!"

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:14.890
You haven't been approved yet...

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:18.030
They ignore me!

00:06:18.030 --> 00:06:21.290
Something about not enough members!

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:23.460
What they really mean is I don't have enough of a record!

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:28.550
They wouldn't treat me like this if I brought them an S Class Lost Precious!

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:31.750
But an S Class...

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.480
Tonight, "Fang" is going to make a trade here.

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:41.340
"Fang" is? Is this item...

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:42.510
That's right.

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:45.010
Shouldn't we contact the police?

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:47.840
If we do that, it won't be mine!

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:52.800
It could be the Lost Precious stolen from me.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:00.230
Well, there's still time.

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.960
We can catch up with each other until tonight.

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:07.790
Ryuji-kun! You've gotten so cute!

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:15.660
They should be here soon.

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:22.650
Eriko-san, I've heard Fang will do anything to get their hands on a Lost Precious.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:26.450
Do we really stand a chance against people like that?

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:30.150
Tada!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:31.480
What is that?

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:33.580
I got it in America.

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:36.880
It'll make you perform miracles.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.510
The previous owner was a magician.

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:44.170
He was killed by the Mafia for claiming he could conjure a swarm of  butterflies.

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:47.900
In other words, this thing is full of his spirit.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:51.300
What do you think? Isn't it a genuine Lost Precious?

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:57.700
Don't worry, it's not a Cursed Precious.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.300
It's not cursed.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.660
Are you still worried about what happened three years ago?

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:06.490
Well...

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:11.720
It doesn't bother me.

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:34.040
That must be an S Class Lost Precious!

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:37.040
This is really dangerous, Eriko-san.

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.200
Let's go, Ryuji-kun!

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:42.430
Someone's there!

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:47.600
Genbu, Kocho!

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:57.860
Kakusei!

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:04.150
Go get it!

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:05.850
Okay!

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:12.580
What are you doing? Hurry!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:15.410
It's heavy...

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:16.310
Come on!

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:21.540
Get in!

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:26.340
Did he really shoot at me?

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:30.840
Let's make a break for it!

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:33.400
Accomplices?

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:35.370
Cautious, aren't they?

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:39.630
They're chasing us!

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:40.730
I'm not surprised!

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:50.960
Ryuji-kun, hold on!

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:52.020
I am holding on!

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:52.860
Oh, really?

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:03.620
Ryuji-kun, take the wheel!

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:08.850
Genbu, Hotarubi!

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:20.910
They're persistent.

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:22.910
Eriko-san, in front of you!

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:24.170
Damn it!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.130
Ryuji-kun, the case!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:31.630
Hurry!

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.930
Why is this happening to me?

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:41.160
Ryuji-kun, forget it! Come back!

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.910
Ryuji?

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:51.750
This could be greater than an S Class...

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:07.010
He's not back.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.500
I haven't been to your house in a long time!

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:14.170
Keep your voice down!

00:12:14.470 --> 00:12:18.500
Once your utilities start working again, please leave!

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:20.270
I know.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:24.230
Who am I supposed to call for the electricity and water?

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.260
Who is this girl?

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:32.220
You really have no idea?

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.120
I don't.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:37.320
But she knows your name.

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:39.190
I know, but...

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:44.020
There's no way I'd forget a fire spewing girl...

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:47.780
Could that be this Lost Precious' power?

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:49.350
She woke up.

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:54.340
We're safe now, so why don't you show me that necklace?

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:58.040
Ow!

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.040
Ryuji-kun! Get it off, get it off, get it off!

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.340
What am I supposed to do?

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:05.900
It hurts! It hurts!

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:14.260
Ryuji!

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:21.290
Ryuji, Ryuji, Ryuji!

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:23.130
Hey!

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:24.830
Have we met?

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:27.560
How do you know my name?

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:29.160
Ryuji!

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:33.190
She's taken quite a liking to you.

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:39.030
Jina lako ni nani?

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.550
Ryuji!

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:42.550
She's doesn't understand Swahili either.

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:45.180
The only thing she says is "Ryuji."

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:48.010
She must know you.

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.940
I really have no idea who she is!

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:51.570
Ryuji, Ryuji!

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:54.040
Looks like you're having fun.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:57.040
Communicating with her will be difficult.

00:13:57.040 --> 00:14:00.200
Our only clue is...

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:05.900
We won't hurt you.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:07.000
Okay?

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:08.430
Ryuji!

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:11.300
How come she listens to you?

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:13.260
I don't know!

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:17.090
I can't find her anywhere on the Society's list...

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:21.890
We really should contact the police or Society headquarters.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:26.090
But then this Lost Precious won't be mine.

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:28.650
Doesn't this belong to her?

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:33.750
Besides, if we're found out, you'll be expelled from the organization.

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:35.610
You have a point.

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:39.250
Ryuji-kun, look after her tonight.

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:41.280
What? Why me?

00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:44.540
Because she doesn't like anyone else.

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:46.870
Ryuji.

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:53.400
I can't take care of a girl!

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:55.570
You want me to do it?

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:58.130
I don't mean to brag, but it won't be pretty.

00:14:58.130 --> 00:14:59.870
Don't boast!

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:05.230
Can you really abandon a girl so attached to you?

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:08.430
Ryuji?

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:14.520
Fine.

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:15.890
It's settled!

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:20.150
I'm hungry. Ryuji-kun, make me dinner.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:22.680
She'll need a change of clothes, too.

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:25.020
I'll give you my card, so could you go shopping?

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:30.710
How can two girls need so much?

00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:32.550
Ryuji-kun!

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:35.010
Eto-san?

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:36.840
What's wrong?

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:39.040
Oh, um...

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:42.710
You left your bag this afternoon, so I...

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:45.470
Were you waiting for me?

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:49.430
You could have rang the bell. Eriko-san is...

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:53.730
Um, Ryuji-kun.

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:56.700
Who was that girl?

00:15:57.800 --> 00:15:59.490
Sorry, hold on.

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:01.180
Hello?

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.590
Ryuji-kun, come back quick!

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:03.730
Hurry!

00:16:04.390 --> 00:16:05.860
Eto-san, thanks!

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:07.220
Sorry! I'll see you tomorrow!

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.080
What... happened?

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:20.480
Come on!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:22.410
Ryuji-kun!

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:23.480
Eriko-san?

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:27.410
She starting acting up the moment you left!

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:30.340
She ruined her clothes so I put her in the bath, but...

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:32.470
she's out of control!

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:34.970
What are you doing?

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:36.870
But listen to this!

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:40.770
Ryuji!

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:44.600
Wait! Stop!

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:46.130
Ryuji!

00:16:47.430 --> 00:16:50.630
I took the bandages off her arm! Ryuji-kun, look!

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.130
I can't look!

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:53.890
Look at her hand!

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:57.460
There's dragon scales on her hand!

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:59.390
Dragon?

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:02.990
She's the legendary red dragon!

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.620
Red dragon?

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.020
Ryuji!

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:17.480
Ryuji-kun, you're a great cook.

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:21.340
Women love great cooks.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:22.910
You don't need to flatter me.

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:26.310
You've never eaten this before?

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:40.930
Do you want more?

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:43.000
Here.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:48.090
Ryuji-kun, you'd make a good mother.

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:51.890
Is she really a dragon?

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:54.320
She looks like a human girl to me...

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:58.420
Apparently, dragons don't look any different from humans.

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:00.590
Other than the scales on the back of their hand...

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:06.280
they can transform into this figure once they reach maturity.

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.980
Where did you learn all that?

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:10.810
Nevermind that!

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:14.110
I'm amazed we have our own dragon!

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:17.810
A single scale or claw is an S Class Lost Precious!

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:22.340
That may be true, but she's more than we can handle.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:26.370
We should have the Society come get her as soon as possible.

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.900
By the way, Ryuji-kun...

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:32.130
where did you meet this dragon?

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:35.630
I haven't met her. I...

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:42.990
Maybe we should talk to your parents.

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:45.120
I wouldn't bother.

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:48.860
I'm sure my parents are absorbed in some other Lost Precious.

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:52.620
Are you going to help me?

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:55.220
Ryuji!

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.150
She needs a name.

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:01.010
She keeps calling your name.

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:04.810
Rose...

00:19:06.440 --> 00:19:08.080
How does Rose sound?

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:10.710
The pattern on her hand looks like one.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:15.410
You've got an effeminate way of thinking.

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:17.870
I guess it's not bad.

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:20.200
Rose!

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:23.500
Eriko.

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:25.730
Ryuji.

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:28.960
Rose.

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:30.600
Rose!

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:33.890
Ryuji!

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:36.190
Rose!

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:39.290
Ryuji! Rose!

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:38.890
What about "Eriko?"

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:40.800
It's an unidentified creature.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:43.500
What is a monster like that doing here?

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:45.320
Is she studying?

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:47.870
She can't be.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:51.720
I hope she learns to talk. There's a lot I want to ask her.

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:55.380
What? You want some?

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:58.610
Dragons act more common than I thought.

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:02.640
Ice cream.

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:03.940
Ice?

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:11.970
Eriko.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:15.200
Eriko! Ice, ice, ice!

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:17.830
That's good enough.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:23.000
You're right. Ice cream is a woman's friend.

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:24.430
Ice!

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:25.260
Hey!

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:26.460
Ryuji!

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:28.130
That's mine!

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:31.030
Eriko-san, calm down!

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:31.010
Give it back!

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.310
Ryuji? Ryuji!

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:56.410
Rose? You're supposed to be sleeping with Eriko-san!

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:58.440
You didn't notice?

00:20:58.470 --> 00:21:01.270
I was really tired yesterday.

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:05.240
I see. What's for breakfast?

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:07.840
Break! Fast!

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:09.400
You can talk?

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:13.500
She was watching TV all last night.

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:19.330
Ryuji-kun, I'd like miso soup now that I'm finally back in Japan.

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:34.990
Let's eat.

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:37.220
Let's eat!

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:47.440
Good morning!

00:21:47.580 --> 00:21:50.380
Is there a dragon here?

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:51.380
"Whup whup."

00:21:51.800 --> 00:21:53.850
Whup whup!

00:23:24.940 --> 00:23:39.790
Next Episode "The Black Assault"

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:27.890
I'm Rose!

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:30.130
I like Ryuji!

00:23:30.330 --> 00:23:31.760
I love him, I love him!

00:23:31.940 --> 00:23:33.650
I love Ryuji!

00:23:33.940 --> 00:23:35.390
I love him, I love him!

